          "date": "2026-11-02 22:16:50.000000000",
          "tz": -480
        },
        "subject": "LU-21089 tests: destroy the middle of three snapshots",
        "message": "LU-21089 tests: destroy the middle of three snapshots\n\nNo sanity-lsnapshot subtest destroys a snapshot that has a newer\none after it, or checks the other snapshots' data after a destroy.\nAdd test_7: take three snapshots with different file contents,\ndestroy the middle one, and check that the other two still mount\nand show their own data. On ldiskfs over LVM thin LVs this checks\nthat removing one thin LV leaves the blocks of the other snapshots\nalone.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial fstype=zfs testlist=sanity-lsnapshot\nSigned-off-by: Hiroshi Nishida <hnishida@thelustrecollective.com>\nAssisted-by: ClaudeCode:claude-opus-5-5\nChange-Id: I4e856abd07bba6fbfd75efe7ea2e36530d84ed83\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
